1. DEFINITIONS

1.1 "Project" means the CPYOS firmware, source code, build scripts, documentation,
assets and other materials published by the CPYOS project, excluding Third-Party
Components.

1.2 "Public Source" means the portion of the Project's source code that the CPYOS
project publishes in its public repository.

1.3 "JJWXC Component" means the private component that implements the JJWXC client,
including the source and binaries under `src/jjwxc/` or the `cpyos-jjwxc` repository.

1.4 "Official Build" means a firmware image built by the CPYOS project from the
Project and distributed by the project under this license.

1.5 "Third-Party Components" means software, fonts, data and other materials that
are not original CPYOS work and are distributed under their own licenses, including
those listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

1.6 "Commercial Use" means any use that is primarily intended for or directed toward
commercial advantage or monetary compensation. It includes, without limitation:
(a) selling, renting, leasing, licensing or sublicensing the Project or Official
Builds; (b) charging for downloads, subscriptions, unlocking, flashing,
installation, customization, integration, maintenance or support; (c) preinstalling,
bundling or distributing the Project with devices, products or services that are
sold, rented or supplied for business purposes; (d) use in business operations,
client deliveries, commercial product development, or advertising-funded services;
(e) use by a company or other organization in the course of its business.

1.7 "Personal Use" means use by an individual for personal learning, research,
testing, reading of content the individual is lawfully entitled to access, and
non-commercial sharing of feedback and Official Builds.

2. GRANT

Subject to this license, you may:

(a) use, copy and modify the Public Source for Personal Use;
(b) build firmware from the Public Source for Personal Use on devices you own or
control;
(c) run Official Builds on devices you own or control for Personal Use;
(d) share Official Builds and unmodified Public Source free of charge for Personal
Use, provided you keep this license and all notices intact;
(e) share modified Public Source or modified builds for Personal Use, provided you
clearly mark them as unofficial, keep this license and all notices intact, and do
not imply endorsement by the CPYOS project;
(f) if you are an authorized contributor, access and modify the JJWXC Component
under the project's contributor terms.

